               <code code="51945-4" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="PACKAGE LABEL.PRINCIPAL DISPLAY PANEL"/>
               <title>Principal Display Panel</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Compare to the active ingredient in Nicorette® Mini Lozenge††</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>
                     <content styleCode="bold">Nicotine Mini Lozenges</content>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph>NICOTINE POLACRILEX LOZENGE 2 mg </paragraph>
                  <paragraph>STOP SMOKING AID</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Sugar Free</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>
                     <content styleCode="bold">FOR THOSE WHO SMOKE THEIR FIRST CIGARETTE MORE THAN 30 MINUTES AFTER WAKING UP.</content>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph>If you smoke your first cigarette <content styleCode="bold">
                        <content styleCode="underline">WITHIN</content> 30 MINUTES </content>of waking up, use Nicotine Polacrilex Lozenge 4 mg.</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>includes User's Guide</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Cherry flavor</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>LOZENGES</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>
                     <content styleCode="bold">TO INCREASE YOUR SUCCESS IN QUITTING:</content>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph>
                     <content styleCode="bold">1. </content>You must be motivated to quit.</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>
